WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:22,180
This is what it looks like

2
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,220
Zongzu’s consciousness has awakened

3
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:25,780
Taking over the nerve path

4
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:28,300
The fusion is smooth and faster than Yugu’s.

5
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,900
It seems that the old guy dislikes the mind and body so much

6
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:32,780
Do you want to send him to the front line now?

7
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:36,620
The human fleet is still below Tianlei. It’s time to give it a try. The effect is not urgent.

8
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:38,750
Wait until he wakes up completely

9
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:40,630
I want him to walk there by himself

10
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:52,780
Killed Lingcan Jade Zegris with my own hands

11
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:55,300
It's because I've been separated by so many connections

12
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:56,300
wake me up

13
00:00:56,340 --> 00:00:58,380
He's actually a half-dead human being

14
00:00:58,420 --> 00:00:59,780
Natasha that bastard

15
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,740
Put my embryo into a human body

16
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:03,700
A spiritual lock was also engraved on the embryo.

17
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:05,460
Let me control this body for him

18
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:07,020
Absolutely obey his orders

19
00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:09,180
He'd be disgusted with me, so that's fine

20
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:11,020
You don't want to be in my body

21
00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:13,260
I don't want you to stay out either

22
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:20,340
You want to give me my body back?

23
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:21,500
Just fall down

24
00:01:22,370 --> 00:01:23,610
Get up again and again

25
00:01:24,130 --> 00:01:25,330
What's the use

26
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:32,200
There are so many more fights to be fought in just these two days.

27
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:37,160
Humans I've Killed

28
00:01:37,830 --> 00:01:39,630
They were begging for help before they died

29
00:01:39,910 --> 00:01:41,080
You don't ask for help

30
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,700
Useful

31
00:01:42,740 --> 00:01:46,260
What did you say?

32
00:01:50,090 --> 00:01:51,530
You know you can't beat me

33
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:54,720
Why are you still getting up?

34
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:56,280
For your beloved spot

35
00:01:58,180 --> 00:02:02,180
So that's it

36
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:04,700
Then let me be optimistic about it for him

37
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:06,260
you can hold it together

38
00:02:34,930 --> 00:02:36,530
That bastard was right

39
00:02:36,890 --> 00:02:38,930
Your willpower is indeed strong

40
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:51,940
What a master

41
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:53,940
But given your current state

42
00:02:54,420 --> 00:02:57,020
If you try again a hundred times, it will be in vain

43
00:02:58,420 --> 00:02:59,420
this body

44
00:02:59,420 --> 00:03:01,760
I'm in charge now
